# ---------------------------------------------------------------- heavy artifacts
# Model weights, MSAs, structures and tables live under /data/cb/varunullanat, never in git.
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.a3m
*.parquet
*.cif
*.pdb
*.ent
outputs/
wandb/

# Two deliberate exceptions, both small and both needed for the repo to be usable on clone:
#   the trained selectors (both / paired-only / vhh-only, ~2.6 MB), so `PoolSelector()` works with no download
#   the demo pool (~1.3 MB of real predictions), so `examples/` runs immediately
!src/cofoldrank/select/checkpoints/*.joblib
!examples/demo_pool/**/*.cif
!examples/demo_pool/**/*.pdb
